{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds of Valen</strong> is a completely free-to-play fantasy MMORPG inspired by the golden age of old school MMOs like Old School RuneScape. Explore an open world with meaningful, non-linear progression, where your progression is driven by what you choose to pursue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-Linear Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a living world with no set path. Choose your own adventures, travel in any direction, and play at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/a7705d03ed87908ed2d5db58de54839e.poster.avif?t=1773467731\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/a7705d03ed87908ed2d5db58de54839e.webm?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/a7705d03ed87908ed2d5db58de54839e.mp4?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on challenging, mechanics-driven boss encounters and earn powerful gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/ee270f38db9ddb48837483d36edcb567.poster.avif?t=1773467731\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/ee270f38db9ddb48837483d36edcb567.webm?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/ee270f38db9ddb48837483d36edcb567.mp4?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and master your skills:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Skills</strong>: Attack, Archery, Defence, Evasion, Warding and Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professions</strong>: Mining, Smithing, Fishing and Potion making, deeply tied into your equipment, upgrades, and overall progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/13ab9d75c4857859ccd56b75ffec4f79.poster.avif?t=1773467731\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/13ab9d75c4857859ccd56b75ffec4f79.webm?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/13ab9d75c4857859ccd56b75ffec4f79.mp4?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player-Driven Crafting &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, smelt ore, and craft powerful gear. Every tool and weapon has purpose.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.poster.avif?t=1773467731\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.webm?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.mp4?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Reward System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every monster in Winds of Valen drops its own rare, unique item.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare drop chances are displayed openly and dynamically change to prevent getting too unlucky</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item is balanced, useful, and designed to have its place in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/3938c6d6d958b975b03a3c2537bcd0a5.poster.avif?t=1773467731\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/3938c6d6d958b975b03a3c2537bcd0a5.webm?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/3938c6d6d958b975b03a3c2537bcd0a5.mp4?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds of Valen</strong> is built for players who enjoy the open-ended, sandbox design of old-school MMOs.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135880?t=1773467731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135880?t=1773467731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/47aad247c9928286d4e3a177d1210618ce028985/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773467731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/47aad247c9928286d4e3a177d1210618ce028985/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773467731","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winds of Valen</strong> is a completely free-to-play fantasy MMORPG inspired by the golden age of old school MMOs like Old School RuneScape. Explore an open world with meaningful, non-linear progression, where your progression is driven by what you choose to pursue.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-Linear Open World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a living world with no set path. Choose your own adventures, travel in any direction, and play at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/a7705d03ed87908ed2d5db58de54839e.poster.avif?t=1773467731\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/a7705d03ed87908ed2d5db58de54839e.webm?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/a7705d03ed87908ed2d5db58de54839e.mp4?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on challenging, mechanics-driven boss encounters and earn powerful gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/ee270f38db9ddb48837483d36edcb567.poster.avif?t=1773467731\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/ee270f38db9ddb48837483d36edcb567.webm?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/ee270f38db9ddb48837483d36edcb567.mp4?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and master your skills:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Skills</strong>: Attack, Archery, Defence, Evasion, Warding and Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professions</strong>: Mining, Smithing, Fishing and Potion making, deeply tied into your equipment, upgrades, and overall progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/13ab9d75c4857859ccd56b75ffec4f79.poster.avif?t=1773467731\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/13ab9d75c4857859ccd56b75ffec4f79.webm?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/13ab9d75c4857859ccd56b75ffec4f79.mp4?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player-Driven Crafting &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, smelt ore, and craft powerful gear. Every tool and weapon has purpose.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.poster.avif?t=1773467731\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135880/extras/532e969f64d9b57e8ce36d2f102efa31.webm?t=1773467731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><so